WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.702
(birds chirping)
(piano music)

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:07.301
- (speaks in foreign language)

00:00:07.301 --> 00:00:11.468
(birds chirping)
(piano music)

00:00:17.753 --> 00:00:18.952
- [Female Narrator] In Chennai, India,

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:20.737
there's a tiny camera repair shop

00:00:20.737 --> 00:00:23.553
run by a man named Joseph Sekar.

00:00:23.553 --> 00:00:27.470
- (speaks in foreign language)

00:00:29.706 --> 00:00:30.588
- [Female Narrator]
Sekar got his nickname,

00:00:30.588 --> 00:00:33.644
because everyday he feeds
thousands of hungry parakeets

00:00:33.644 --> 00:00:35.852
on the roof of his home.

00:00:35.852 --> 00:00:40.019
- [Joseph] (speaks in foreign language)

00:00:48.056 --> 00:00:49.369
- [Female Narrator] The 2006 tsunami

00:00:49.369 --> 00:00:50.978
that hit southeast Asia

00:00:50.978 --> 00:00:54.678
flooded parts of India and
displaced thousands of birds.

00:00:54.678 --> 00:00:57.590
Sekar noticed a pair of
parakeets outside of his home

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.005
and set some rice out for them.

00:01:00.005 --> 00:01:02.981
Then more started to show up, and well...

00:01:02.981 --> 00:01:06.898
- (speaks in foreign language)

00:01:10.365 --> 00:01:11.698
- [Female Narrator] Feeding
eight thousand parakeets

00:01:11.698 --> 00:01:13.925
twice a day is a great expense.

00:01:13.925 --> 00:01:16.573
Sekar spends about 40%
of the money he makes

00:01:16.573 --> 00:01:17.773
from repairing cameras

00:01:17.773 --> 00:01:19.940
buying food for the birds.

00:01:21.373 --> 00:01:26.028
- [Joseph] (speaks in foreign language)

00:01:26.028 --> 00:01:27.556
- [Female Narrator] But
for the birdman of Chennai,

00:01:27.556 --> 00:01:30.044
there is more to life than money.

00:01:30.044 --> 00:01:34.211
- [Joseph] (speaks in foreign language)

00:01:59.739 --> 00:02:02.406
(upbeat music)

